# Purpose: shows the local-only settings needed by the AI proxy. Connects: developer setup to Groq without storing secrets in Git.
# Create a private copy at api/.env. Create a Groq API key at https://console.groq.com/keys.
GROQ_API_KEY=
# Use a Groq-supported model ID, such as openai/gpt-oss-120b or openai/gpt-oss-20b.
GROQ_MODEL=
